{"ID":"20240118144837-hoawr3s","Spec":"2","Type":"NodeDocument","Properties":{"id":"20240118144837-hoawr3s","scroll":"\u0026#123;\u0026quot;rootId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240118144837-hoawr3s\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;startId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240118144837-r5785vs\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;endId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240122171304-od7o6xc\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;scrollTop\u0026quot;:0\u0026#125;","title":"385补28灶心土（伏龙肝）","type":"doc","updated":"20240204172401"},"Children":[{"ID":"20240118144837-r5785vs","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240118144837-r5785vs","updated":"20240122171244"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"——治吐血，下血，胃家损伤之重症者。今人称伏龙肝。 "},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122171245-8ngsf93","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122171245-8ngsf93"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【产地】乡下土灶烧之多年者佳，新土无效。 "},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122171247-rq5b3ho","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122171247-rq5b3ho"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【性味】味甘性温平，功能补土利湿，修补胃壁之损伤。 "},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122171248-qdwhnrb","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122171248-qdwhnrb"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【主治】胃出血，呕吐血，大便黑等。 "},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122171250-c3s9y1d","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122171250-c3s9y1d"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【仲景】黄土汤用之，治疗便血吐血等。 "},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122171251-jci1xgi","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122171251-jci1xgi"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【用量】一般三钱至五钱。 "},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122171252-jk0psjc","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122171252-jk0psjc"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【禁忌】无。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122171244-y0s7wfu","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122171244-y0s7wfu"}},{"ID":"20240122171252-tp8bstj","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122171252-tp8bstj"}},{"ID":"20240122171252-6nsj19t","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122171252-6nsj19t","updated":"20240204171949"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"28就是我们前面介绍过的灶心土，治：吐血，下血，胃家损伤的重症，现在人称伏龙肝。"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"现在能够把破损的胃修补好的，就是一个灶心土。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"那这里讲吐血，下血，跟一般的肺有问题导致的吐血、下血又不一样，胃里面吐血出来，灶心土味甘性平，能补土利湿，修补胃壁的损伤，因为吃土补土嘛，那个灶心土是因为经过火烧过十几年以后，在那个锅子里面反复炒，这个土烧了越多年，效果越强，它主治胃出血，呕吐血。"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"大便是黑色的代表是胃出血，如果大便是鲜红色的，代表说你是痔疮出的血，近血，靠近直肠里面的血，黑色的血代表是远血，从胃来的。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122171257-ddtavhv","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122171257-ddtavhv","updated":"20240204172020"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"一般胃出血的话一定要用到灶心土，这个黄土汤在使用。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"那一般我们会用到土，灶心土，这种东西，那我们会用，比如说会用五钱，起价五钱，那你会用棉布把它包起来，不然一煮的话灰都到处跑，记得要用棉布包起来，我们光用这个土。"}]},{"ID":"20240122171304-od7o6xc","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122171304-od7o6xc","updated":"20240204172401"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"有一种病叫天疱疮，就是小朋友全身皮肤溃烂掉，溃烂到什么程度，如果他的手指头一碰墙壁，碰到一样东西，过5分钟以之后，碰到的东西就会烂掉，化脓，你一抱她，你的手纹的那个地方就会化脓，接触到的地方就糜烂掉，会化脓，这种我们叫"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"天疱疮"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。生下来就有这个问题，可能是前因带下来的哦，爸爸妈妈带下来的。治疗他的方法，当然我们处方的药很多，但是效果没有一种来的好，就是泥土。那怎么治？就找个地方土比较干净的，我跟你讲哦，不要到处都是狗大便。还有人的大便到处都有，你要小心点，到山里面去找片黄土，土质很好挖个洞，把小孩子埋在里面，头露在外面，你不要把整个埋掉，commonsense。头露在外面给他呼吸，爸妈在旁边陪他，就用土把他全身盖住，他就是碰到那个土，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"土用来生金用来长皮肤，皮肤会长的非常好，愈后会非常好"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，很奇怪，就用那个土，那要找干净的土，所以挖前，最好鼻子先闻一下。看看有什么怪味，没有怪味再埋，这样就没有问题，不会发炎，很奇怪，真的不会发炎，土生金，肺，皮肤毛孔是金，所以我们中医用的土可能很多，过去我们看一些报道上面还有一些人在吃土，有没有？拿土来吃啊，实际上土是可以吃的，土本来就是脾胃嘛，但不是每种土都可以吃，在经方里面我们治疗胃出血、胃癌，一定会使用到这个灶心土。"}]}]}